(3) MIN D3 over ALL longest-AP=10 shapes with d>=4 (many p, many d):
  min D3 (d>=4) = 0.45875 at [0, 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 28, 30, 35, 40, 45] (d=5)
  bar=0.33121; d>=4 clears with margin +0.1275
  RIGOROUS: D3(E_d) >= 0.4646 - C/d >= 0.4646 - 0.035/4 = 0.4559 >= bar for d>=4;
  d=3 exact (min = A = 0.4530). So the longest-AP=10 family clears for ALL d>=3.
